(-> :delivered-event-cost/v1 selected-id)
(-> "Selected :delivered-event-cost/v1 because it is the only current callable that accepts a delivery-charge parameter and explicitly documents that the delivery charge is added after surcharge calculation, matching the requirement for a fixed delivery charge that is not surcharged. Rejected :event-cost/v1 because it lacks a delivery-charge parameter and would incorrectly surcharge the delivery fee if added externally. Rejected :event-cost/obsolete and :operator/legacy-v1 due to superseded status and incompatible interfaces. Rejected :operator/linear-v1 and :operator/percentage-v1 as they are partial operators, not the whole delivered quote callable." selection-notes)